713                        ;************************************************************************
714                        ;   WRP_FLASH
715                        ;   This routine writes one 256-byte FLASH sector.
716                        ;   Each sector will contain 84 (24-bit) words from DSP RAM (252 bytes)
717                        ;   The last 4 bytes contain a 16-bit checksum of the data
718                        ;   followed by two blank bytes.
719                        ;
720                        ;   enter with:  r2 pointing to starting PEROM Byte Address from 56309 p.o.v.
721                        ;                r0 pointing to first DSP word to save
722                        ;
723                        ;   corrupts:    r0 - points to next P:memory location to save
724                        ;                r2 - points to next P:FLASH byte address to write
725                        ;                a,b,x0
726                        ;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
727    
728                        WRP_FLASH
729       P:002043 20001B            clr     b                                 ;initialize checksum
