835                        ;**************************************************************************
836                        ;  this is the bootstrap loader
837                        ;  it is loaded into the P:memory at boot time.
838                        ;  After reset the external EEPROM appears as byte wide mem at P:D00000
839                        ;  This bootloader moves the user's code into 56309 pram beginning at p:0
840                        ;  and data into the X data mem beginning at x:0
841                        ;
842                        ;
843    
844                        BOOT
845       P:002087                   dc      BOOT_END-BOOT                     ;storage for size of boot
846       P:002088                   dc      bootgo                            ;storage for address of boot
847                        bootgo
